		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds &nbsp;(Read 11533 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1028" title="View the profile of Rylden">Rylden</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 50<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/morpehus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1028"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg15945#msg15945"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg15945#msg15945">Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> March 30, 2005, 10:10:05 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							From the information I have gathered it appears that it will look like this:<br /><br />1. Vis Maior<br />2. Dol Amroth/Echoes in Eternity<br />3. Wraith/Reviviscence<br />4. Conviction<br />5. Cold Fury<br />6. Moonlight Crusaders<br />7-9 Inner Loop, Union of Power, Dawning Nemesis<br />10. Outcast Adventurers<br /><br />That is based on everything I have read on both boards.  7,8, and 9 are interchangeable as I believe all are one kill away from Time.  Correct me if I&#039;m wrong.<br /><br />Let the games begin!
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: March 30, 2005, 10:38:00 am by Rylden</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=995577" target="_blank"><img src="http://img104.exs.cx/img104/5755/ryldensig23gj.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15946"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
