	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15947"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1095" title="View the profile of Qutsemnie">Qutsemnie</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 16<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1095"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg15947#msg15947"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg15947#msg15947">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> March 30, 2005, 10:34:22 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Midnight crusadors is &quot;Moonlight Crusaders&quot; <br /><br />The Quellious order is correct though sorting out how they interweave is a trick =)<br />Relavent webpages in no particular order are:<br />&nbsp;<br /><a href="http://www.moonlightcrusaders.com/" target="_blank">http://www.moonlightcrusaders.com/</a>  (Indicative Content:Finishing up learning time)<br /><br /><a href="http://reviviscence.home.comcast.net/" target="_blank">http://reviviscence.home.comcast.net/</a> Which is joined in a years old raiding alliance with <a href="http://www.wraithguild.com/index1.html" target="_blank">http://www.wraithguild.com/index1.html</a><br />(Officers of each are basically officers for the other when it comes to raid choices.  Its a tight bond it takes a bit of getting used to if you havent been on a server with such a tight alliance.  Very solidly out of time. They got to Time over a year ago now. Indicative Content: Tacvi South/ one MPG trial/King and Queen of RS)<br /><br /><a href="http://www.explicitguild.net/" target="_blank">http://www.explicitguild.net/</a> (This is vis maior theres a bit of history in explaining why vis maiors website is explicits web site that is prolly beyond the need of this thread. This is the most hardcore of Quellious guilds.  Min raid % and all that uber jazz) Indicative Content: Somewhere in the secrets of Anguish~)<br /><br /><a href="http://www.coldfuryguild.com/" target="_blank">http://www.coldfuryguild.com/</a> (Youll see dedication in that screen shot.  Dedication is a twink/recruit guild of cold furys. Also of relavence is they play on australia&#039;s peak time.) (Indicative Content: Ask them~  I know I have seen them in Qvic/and Queen RS with my own eyes. Though tacvi and MPG trials wouldnt surprise me.)<br /><br />-----------------------------------------------------------<br /><br />So thats all the time+ guilds.  <br />--------------------------------------------------------------<br /><br />The two most active pretime guilds are:<br /><a href="http://www.underguild.com/" target="_blank">http://www.underguild.com/</a>  (Thats the longest running elemental guild that hasnt made it to time yet.  I dont know where they stand on that)<br /><br /><a href="http://vinceremo.com/Home.htm" target="_blank">http://vinceremo.com/Home.htm</a> (The most recent arrival to elemental planes just gaining entry this month not sure what their goals are)<br /><br />edit in:<br /><a href="http://www.radiantguild.org/" target="_blank">http://www.radiantguild.org/</a>&nbsp; (These guys were in elemental planes before Moonlight Crusaders.&nbsp; &nbsp;They are rebuilding it seems.)<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: March 30, 2005, 04:13:54 pm by Qutsemnie</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15950"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=361" title="View the profile of Toastie">Toastie</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hasbeens<br />
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 260<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v612/mrunclepants/Gir_Dance_by_Munger.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The World&#039;s on Heroin<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
