							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg15950#msg15950">Quote from: Toastie on March 30, 2005, 10:47:10 am</a></div><div class="quote">fuck that, they cant just knock me off the top ten list like that...<br /></div><br />Sorry, Toastie... <br /><br />1. Vis Maior<br />2. Dol Amroth/Echoes in Eternity<br />3-4. Wraith/Reviviscence, Cold Fury<br />5. Conviction<br />5.5. Toastie&#039;s Crew<br />6. Moonlight Crusaders<br />7-9. Inner Loop, Union of Power, Dawning Nemesis<br />10. Underguild<br /><br />That better?<br /><br />Cold Fury is currently reflagging for Txevu, but are Australian based so don&#039;t raid with the rest of the server.&nbsp; Which means, they are up with Wraith/Revi. unless I get something more concrete.
