	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15963"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1097" title="View the profile of Gaeaan">Gaeaan</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1097"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg15963#msg15963"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg15963#msg15963">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> March 30, 2005, 11:50:25 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">The two most active pretime guilds are:<br /><a href="http://www.underguild.com/" target="_blank">http://www.underguild.com/</a>&nbsp; (Thats the longest running elemental guild that hasnt made it to time yet.&nbsp; I dont know where they stand on that)<br /></div><br />Heya Rodcet.&nbsp; Leader of UG on Quellious.&nbsp; Hehe, we didn&#039;t &quot;plan&quot; on being in elementals nearly this long, but we&#039;re a firm believer in making sure everyone gets all the gear they want from content before moving on (read: we farm like we&#039;re posessed).&nbsp; We&#039;re currently working on Cor (hopefully we&#039;ll have him dead this week) and then starting up RC.&nbsp; We&#039;re fully KT flagged and also have some of the Ikky trials down.<br /><br />There&#039;s another guild on Quellious that&#039;s in ele&#039;s atm, not listed here (Radiant).&nbsp; They&#039;ve actually been in eles longer than us.&nbsp; I know they have a Fennin kill under their belts, and from what I understand, they&#039;re gonna start on Xeg and Cor soon.&nbsp; That&#039;s all just grapevine info though.<br /><br />Look forward to seeing ya&#039;ll in 6 weeks.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
