							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							NOOOOO!<br /><br />We made #7 and now we aren&#039;t even in the top 10 anymore!!<br /><br />Blast!<br /><br />Oh well... that&#039;s what you get when you only raid 2 days a week.<br /><br />Yeah - Vinceremo is just entering Elemental now - our goals are slow progression cause we don&#039;t consider ourselves a raiding guild.
