						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16003#msg16003"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16003#msg16003">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> March 30, 2005, 03:07:13 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I think we need to expand to a top 15.&nbsp; When I see all these funky Quelius guild tags running around, I would like to know if it&#039;s a raiding guild or not, period.&nbsp; I&#039;d also like to sorta get the idea of exactly what the Quelious guild tags mean relative to our beloved Rodcet tags.&nbsp; But that&#039;s just my opinion.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
