								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16004#msg16004">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> March 30, 2005, 03:12:59 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well, if we&#039;re expanding, then I&#039;d see Radiant &amp; OA at 11&amp;12 (not sure who would be above who, both have only FR kills?), then BrewMasters at 13 with elemental access...not sure how it falls out after that... LoS would be in there somewhere, but I think there might be a Quellious guild or two between them and Brews.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
