	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16008"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1095" title="View the profile of Qutsemnie">Qutsemnie</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 16<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1095"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16008#msg16008"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16008#msg16008">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> March 30, 2005, 03:30:08 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I ~almost~ changed my underguild comment of longest elemental guild not in time but i noticed right before that I said actively raiding[and radiant had a serious lull].  <br /><br />A backgrounder.  Radiant was ahead of Moonlight Crusaders once upon a time.  Entered elemental planes noticably ahead of MC.  In fact when I first joined my current guild over a year ago I got two of my pre-elemental flags on xflags with radiant.  So they were hopping.  But then sort of dried up... Ok so I looked them up for this post.  They are in a pre-elemental/early elemental rebuilding phase it looks like.<br /><br /><a href="http://www.radiantguild.org/" target="_blank">http://www.radiantguild.org/</a><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
