								<a href="mailto:ktadema@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16009#msg16009"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16009#msg16009">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> March 30, 2005, 03:35:37 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Vinceremo has just started raiding elements, I saw someone say, so they are probably #13, with our beloved Brew Masters at #14.  LOS #15?  I haven&#039;t seen anything from Q. raiding in early POP...yet...<br /><br />1. Vis Maior  (Entrenced in Aguish)<br />2. Dol Amroth/Echoes in Eternity  (Starting Anguish)<br />3-4. Wraith/Reviviscence, Cold Fury (Various stages in GoD)<br />5. Conviction (Coming out of Time, various stages of GoD)<br />6. Moonlight Crusaders (Time Farming)<br />7.&nbsp; Inner Loop (missing Coirnav)<br />8-9. Union of Power, Dawning Nemesis (missing Rathe Council)<br />10. Underguild (Perma farming Elementals)<br />11. Outcast Adventurers (Fennin Ro killed)<br />12.&nbsp; Radiant (FR kill, backflagging after lull)<br />13.  Vinceremo (Raiding elementals)<br />14.  Brew Masters (Missing Sol Ro, about to start raiding elementals)<br />15.  League of Sozobon (Flagging tier 1 mobs)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
